{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Alume 是一款重新定義 RSS 訂閱體驗的智能閱讀工具，適合希望高效聚合網站、部落格與電子報內容的使用者。它利用人工智能自動摘要、標籤化並組織您的閱讀清單，讓資訊獲取變得井井有條，現正限時免費提供下載。</p>\n\n<h2>AI 驅動個人化智慧摘要</h2>\n<p>這款應用允許您建立包含關鍵字、來源或發布日期等規則的自定義動態源，並透過連接 Claude、ChatGPT 或 Gemini 等多種 AI 模型生成每日智能摘要。除了自動標籤建議與高亮註釋功能外，Alume 還深度整合蘋果生態系統，支援主螢幕小部件、Siri 捷徑及 iCloud 跨裝置同步，且承諾無廣告、不強制訂閱並尊重用戶數據隱私，讓您完全掌控閱讀流程與成本。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-103-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-104-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-105-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-106-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-107-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-108-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Alume: RSS &amp; Podcasts Reader</li>\n<li>應用類別：News</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T22:38:08.377788+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}